  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/12/P1230761.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(169 fotos) Durante todo este domingo se puede disfrutar todav&iacute;a del Mercat de Nadal, en la plaza del Raval de Sant Josep de Onda, con el taller de galletas navide&ntilde;as, que repite Saray T&iacute;o Palomar, de Nubes de Az&uacute;car, las interesantes ofertas que presenta Ana Catal&aacute;n Gui&ntilde;&oacute;n, de Lluna Estilistes, o lo que ofrece Servicios Mu&ntilde;oz.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatnadal15divendresdissabte/img_4441.jpg\" alt=\"img_4441\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatnadal15divendresdissabte/img_4443.jpg\" alt=\"img_4443\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatnadal15divendresdissabte/img_4444.jpg\" alt=\"img_4444\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatnadal15divendresdissabte/img_4445.jpg\" alt=\"img_4445\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatnadal15divendresdissabte/img_4446.jpg\" alt=\"img_4446\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatnadal15divendresdissabte/img_4447.jpg\" alt=\"img_4447\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatnadal15divendresdissabte/img_4450.jpg\" alt=\"img_4450\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatnadal15divendresdissabte/img_4451.jpg\" alt=\"img_4451\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25df